    {
      "caption": "EDIT + REC writes over INSTR's instrument instead. It asks first, REPLACE I06?, and EDIT + REC again does it.",
      "control": "hold EDIT and press REC, then wait 1.5 s, then hold EDIT and press REC, then wait 1.3 s",
      "expect": [
